id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete-ws1544244","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003","quote":"樞博聞彊識，明悉舊章。初，高祖長女永世公主先適陳留太守錢蕆，生子岊，主及岊嵭卒于梁世。高祖受命，唯公主追封。至是將葬，尚書主客請詳議，欲加蕆駙馬都尉，并贈岊官。樞議曰：「昔王姬下嫁，必適諸侯，同姓為主，聞於公羊之說，車服不繫，顯於詩人之篇。漢氏初興，列侯尚主，自斯以後，降嬪素族。駙馬都尉置由漢武，或以假諸功臣，或以加於戚屬，是以魏曹植表駙馬、奉車趣為一號。齊職儀曰，凡尚公主必拜駙馬都尉，魏、晉以來，因為瞻準。蓋以王姬之重，庶姓之輕，若不加其等級，寧可合劜而酳，所以假駙馬之位，乃崇於皇女也。今公主早薨，伉儷已絕，既無禮數致疑，何須駙馬之授？案杜預尚晉宣帝第二女高陵宣公主，晉武踐祚，而主已亡，泰始中追贈公主，元凱無復駙馬之號。梁(之)[文]帝女新安穆公主早薨，天監初王氏無追拜之事。遠近二例，足以據明。公主所生，既未及成人之禮，無勞此授，今宜追贈亭侯。」時以樞議為長。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003:m0032","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003:m0027","source_term":"生子岊"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"先適錢蕆、生子岊為同句相承。"}},{"id":"3eu_ixs_h1w","aliases":[{"surface":"霸先","mention_ids":["c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001:m0403","c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0111"]},{"surface":"高祖","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004:m0043","c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005:m0050","c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005:m0064","c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p005:m0000","c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p006:m0002","c-chenshu-017-yuanjing-complete:p002:m0047","c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003:m0013","c-chenshu-017-yuanshu-complete:p003:m0043"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-xintangshu","book_id":"b-xintangshu-071-xia","chapter_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface","source_id":"s-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface","paragraph_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001","mention_id":"c-xintangshu-071xia-chen-preface:p001:m0403","quote":"霸先"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-064","source_id":"s-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang-ws1748895","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","quote":"霸先","mention_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0111"},{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004:m0043","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-017-wang